  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-01",
  "title": "龍門之行",
  "storyCode": "2-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "daf8e25787742fcbbeb674c3139e7628e3e7216f35b71ab2852df67e4a3bb1bb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十三关（前）\n5:57 a.m. \\ 多雲 \\ 能見度 17公里\n龍門外環外4公里，荒漠\n切爾諾伯格營救行動 結束後4天"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}, 早上好。您已經休息了99999999————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————個小時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然我知道您很不願意起床，不過有人需要您立刻前往作戰會議室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另外來自凱爾希醫生的醫學建議，希望您多開窗保持通風，並且進入甲板曬太陽以平衡維生素D。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊，是博士！早啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "{@nickname}博士，你來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "博士身體好些了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "昨天看你好像還有些傷痛，行動不太方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我已經完全恢復了。你呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "感覺今天活力滿滿的，已經沒什麼問題了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "畢竟接下來，我們還有別的任務......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "需要早點做好準備。博士也要把快速調整當成常態哦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "之前我們在切城的行動，雖然遭受了很大損失，但是獲得了不少關於整合運動的情報，而且還救出了博士您。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "根據昨天會談的結果，我們最近的移動城市————“龍門”，已向我們發送了一份合作框架協議，同意與我們交換情報。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "而有跡象顯示“龍門”已經成為整合運動下一個行動目標。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "關於其他的內容，還需經過尚在龍門城內的凱爾希醫生同意後，才能定下來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "龍門暫時答應了我們停泊在城市附近的要求，然後他們願意給予一部分我們在行動中損失的物資，以及消耗的補給。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "作為交換，羅德島需要協助龍門，進行城市外環的一些臨時性防衛工作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "不過今天這麼早是因為......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "我來說吧，阿米婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "從昨天晚上開始，又有一波切爾諾伯格的倖存者在荒野中被發現，他們正在移動前往龍門，預計下午到達。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "和之前幾天一樣，我們仍然需要對龍門5區的外圍進行防衛工作，只不過這次，可能會混入更多的整合運動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "戰況有所不同，我們在出發之前需要告訴您一種新的戰術策略。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "那麼博士，今天還請多多指教......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "加油！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "那麼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "請你們各自完成出發前的準備。博士請把準備好的編隊配置命令下達給其他幹員，讓他們做好準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "完成演習後15分鐘出發。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "這次，千萬不要遲到。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
